Which vector shown is equal to $\underset{\sim}{u}$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[help lines] (0,0) grid (6,5);
\draw[->,thick] (0,0) -- (4,1) node[midway,below right] {$\underset{\sim}{u}$};
\draw[->,thick] (1,3) -- (5,4) node[midway,below right] {$\underset{\sim}{v}$};
\draw[->,thick] (5,5) -- (1,4) node[midway,above] {$\underset{\sim}{w}$};
\draw[->,thick] (5,0) -- (6,2) node[midway,right] {$\underset{\sim}{t}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which vector shown is the negative of $\underset{\sim}{g}$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[help lines] (0,0) grid (7,5);
\draw[->,thick] (1,0) -- (4,2) node[midway,below right] {$\underset{\sim}{g}$};
\draw[->,thick] (4,0) -- (7,2) node[midway,below right] {$\underset{\sim}{m}$};
\draw[->,thick] (4,5) -- (1,3) node[midway,above left] {$\underset{\sim}{h}$};
\draw[->,thick] (7,5) -- (5,3) node[midway,above right] {$\underset{\sim}{k}$};
